span>the lack of materials.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong> The Director of Studies is concerned about</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>the cost of upgrading the centre.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>the lack of space in the centre.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>the difficulty in supervising the centre.</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4},{"id":"en-c9-t2-l-g3-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 25-30","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS for each answer.</p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong>Necessary improvements to the existing Self-Access Centre</strong></p><p><b>Equipment</b></p><p>Replace computers to create more space.</p><p><b>Resources</b></p><p>The level of the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">25</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> materials, in particular, should be more clearly shown.</p><p>Update the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">26</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> collection.</p><p>Buy some <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">27</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and divide them up.</p><p><b>Use of the room</b></p><p>Speak to the teachers and organise a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">28</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> for supervising the centre.</p><p>Install an <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">29</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q29\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> .</p><p>Restrict personal use of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">30</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> on computers.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":6}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cambridge-ielts-09-academic-listening-test-2-3.mp3"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-c9-t2-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3164539-cambridge-ielts-09-academic-listening-test-2-4.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-c9-t2-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong>Business Cultures</strong></p><p><b>Power culture</b></p><table><tbody><tr><td>Characteristics of organisation</td><td><ul><li>small</li><li><span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> power source</li><li>few rules and procedures</li><li>communication by <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q32\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Advantage:</td><td><ul><li>can act quickly</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Disadvantage:</td><td><ul><li>might not act <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Suitable employee:</td><td><ul><li>not afraid of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>doesn't need job security</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Role culture</b></p><table><tbody><tr><td>Characteristics of organisation:</td><td><ul><li>large, many <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>specialised departments</li><li>rules and procedure, e.g. job <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and rules for discipline</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Advantages:</td><td><ul><li>economies of scale</li><li>successful when <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> ability is important</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Disadvantages:</td><td><ul><li>slow to see when <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> is needed</li><li>slow to react</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Suitable employee:</td><td><ul><li>values security</li><li>doesn't want <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Task culture</b></p><table><tbody><tr><td>Characteristics of organisation:</td><td><ul><li>project orientated</li><li>in competitive market or making product with short life</li><li>a lot of delegation</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Advantage:</td><td><ul><li><span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c9-t2-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Disadvantages:</td><td><ul><li>no economies of scale or special expertise</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Suitable employee:</td><td><ul><li>likes to work in groups</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cambridge-ielts-09-academic-listening-test-2-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-c9-t2-l-q1","part_id":"en-c9-t2-l-p1","group_id":"en-c9-t2-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"diagram_labelling","question_text":"","correct_answer":"Bhatt","correct_answer_variants":["Bhatt"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listeni